@startuml
title macpro-appian-connector – Repository-Supported Architecture (Requirements View)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 220

rectangle "Local Environment" as Local {
  component "Stage Listing Procedure\n(run listRunningStages)" as StageList
  component "Connector Config Handler" as ConnectorConfig
  component "Deployment Metrics Collector\n(from GitHub Actions)" as DeployMetrics
  component "PR Metrics Collector\n(from GitHub PRs)" as PRMetrics
}

cloud "AWS Account (current region)" as AWS {
  component "Project Service\n(runtime events)" as ProjectService
  component "EventBridge Rule\n(event filtering criteria)" as EventBridge
  component "SNS Topic\n(notification topic)" as SNSTopic
  component "Target Cluster & Service\n(cluster=${cluster}, service=${service})" as TargetCluster
}

cloud "GitHub" as GH {
  component "Actions API\n(deploy.yml workflow runs)" as ActionsAPI
  component "Pull Requests API\n(closed PRs for base branch)" as PullReqAPI
}

database "Connector Definitions\n(defined connectors collection)" as ConnectorDefs
folder "Subscription Targets\n(manually managed)" as SubTargets

' Flows
StageList -down-> AWS : Query running stages\n(requires onboarding + AWS CLI creds)\nOutput: runningStages=<comma-separated stages>
ConnectorConfig --> ConnectorDefs : Consume definitions
ConnectorConfig --> TargetCluster : Put connectors\nCall delete with empty set\nRestart configured connectors
ProjectService --> EventBridge : Matching runtime events
EventBridge --> SNSTopic : Route events to topic
SNSTopic --> SubTargets : Distribute notifications\n(manual subscription management)

DeployMetrics --> ActionsAPI : List workflow runs (per_page=100)\nAggregate paginated results
PRMetrics --> PullReqAPI : List closed PRs for base branch\nAggregate paginated results

note right of DeployMetrics
Output: failedRuns, passedRuns
Rule: failed = (conclusion != success)
passed = total - failed
end note

note right of PRMetrics
Output: averageTimeToMerge (hours)
Whole-hour differences; default 0 if none
end note

@enduml
